390 - We Love Thy Sabbath, Lord
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 390
Topic: Doctrines - 

Verse 1:
[F/C]We love [Am/E]Thy [Gm/D]Sabbath, [F/C]Lord, [C7]And [F/C]worship [Dm]at [Edim]Thy [F/C]will;
[Bb]Oh [Am]may these hours sweet [C7/Bb]peace [Bb]afford [Dm/A]And [C/G]deeper [F/C]faith [C7/Bb]instill.

Verse 2:
[F/C]Thine [Am/E]angels [C7]sang [Gm/D]for [Edim]joy
[F/C]Cration's work to [Edim]see;
[Bb]We [Am]too, this [C7/Bb]day, would [Dm/A]raise our [C7/Bb]hearts
[Bb]In [Am/C]grateful [Dm/A]praise to [C7/Bb]Thee.

Verse 3:
[F/C]Praise [Am/E]for [Db]Thy [C7]wondrous [Edim]love,
[F/C]That [Am/E]sealed [F/C]this sacred [Edim]day,
[Bb]A [Am]sign that [C7/Bb]all may [Dm/A]understand
[Bb]We [Am/C]own Thy [Bb]sovereign [C7/Bb]sway.

Verse 4:
[F/C]O [Am/E]great [F/C]Creator [Edim]King,
[F/C]Through [Am/E]Thy [Db]redeeming [Edim]grace,
[Bb]Renew [Am/C]and [C7/Bb]sanctify [Dm/A]our [C7/Bb]hearts
[Bb]That [Am/C]we may [C7/Bb]see [C/G]Thy [F/C]face.

Verse 5:
[F/C]And [Am/E]with [Db]the [C]white-robed [F/C]throng,
[F/C]Upon Mount Sion [Edim]be,
[Bb]And [Am]joyful [C7/Bb]sing our [Dm/A]Sabbath [C7/Bb]song
[Bb]Through [Am/C]all eternity.
